{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728Pawoki: Desktop Pets \u2014 Demo Version\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn your desktop into a living world of adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new digital companion who lives right on your desktop!<br>In the demo version, you can try out the basic features and get a feel for the game\u2019s atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Play right on your desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag your pet with the mouse, watch it stroll through the Start menu, explore the desktop, and even slide along the edges of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/64a7514b2f22675e4e6bc2dbc81f352f.poster.avif?t=1760541077\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/64a7514b2f22675e4e6bc2dbc81f352f.webm?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/64a7514b2f22675e4e6bc2dbc81f352f.mp4?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Try growing food</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a seed, water it, and harvest your first crop!<br>The demo version includes basic tools for planting and watering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/fb41d79baf35092ef71709aec36f4819.poster.avif?t=1760541077\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/fb41d79baf35092ef71709aec36f4819.webm?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell grown vegetables and collected resources to earn coins.<br>In the demo, you can test the market system and basic trading with merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/27751f884b5f2313d2d3e32e9ec7053d.poster.avif?t=1760541077\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/27751f884b5f2313d2d3e32e9ec7053d.webm?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/27751f884b5f2313d2d3e32e9ec7053d.mp4?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96 Take care of your pet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor its <strong>mood</strong>, <strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>thirst</strong>, and <strong>fatigue</strong>.<br>Even in the demo, your pet reacts to your attention \u2014 if it feels bad, it will stop working and might even get upset!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/4c9878f994d50369fc7475ef5d086e83.poster.avif?t=1760541077\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/4c9878f994d50369fc7475ef5d086e83.webm?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/4c9878f994d50369fc7475ef5d086e83.mp4?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Resource management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize items on your desktop and in the inventory.<br>Move them with the mouse, free up space, and watch your pet help you tidy things up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/5971baa36177e4981353b894b6b4db35.poster.avif?t=1760541077\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/5971baa36177e4981353b894b6b4db35.webm?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/extras/5971baa36177e4981353b894b6b4db35.mp4?t=1760541077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Demo version features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on top of all applications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic progress saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with main work programs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic content to get familiar with the mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>This demo is just the beginning!</strong><br>The full version will offer more professions, items, locations, and events.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Try the demo now and meet your future desktop friend!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088150?t=1760541077","background_raw":"https://sh