op of all applications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic progress saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with main work programs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic content to get familiar with the mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>This demo is just the beginning!</strong><br>The full version will offer more professions, items, locations, and events.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Try the demo now and meet your future desktop friend!</p>","developers":["Blastbun"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3995000","name":"Pawoki: Desktop Pets"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088150/20eeac15471efcca74feb852d84f79bd92f1ba07/header.jpg?t=1760541077","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088150/1166017545/58817fe4f4588409dfe6125e8eee6fe41d38258c/1760533681/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760534302","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088150/1166017545/58817fe4f4588409dfe6125e8eee6fe41d38258c/1760533681/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760534302","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4088150/1166017545/58817fe4f4588409dfe6125e8eee6fe41d38258c/1760533681/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760534302","id":257218309,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218309/movie480.mp4?t=1760534302","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218309/movie_max.mp4?t=1760534302"},"name":"Pawoki: Desktop Pets - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218309/62e1d64770137f246c05770bbe0163f17ce84a35/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760534302","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218309/movie480.webm?t=1760534302","max":"h